{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟365在11月12日發生大規模服務中斷，Outlook、Teams、Exchange Online等多項核心服務受到影響，部分用户連續數小時無法正常收發郵件、訪問文件或使用協作工具。微軟表示，故障仍在處理中，雖然部分地區已經出現恢復跡象，但整體服務尚未完全恢復。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586220.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:37:10.907208+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:14:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_hash":"6f4eed81926d00ce70f32a03eccf70e0ff1d68a2095bdf2db868bb0c2c1cdd8b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}